  "description_short": "George institution serving wood-fired pizzas and artisan coffee in a relaxed garden courtyard setting.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in George Central, The Pottery has been a local favourite for years, drawing crowds for its authentic wood-fired pizzas and excellent coffee. The relaxed courtyard setting, complete with garden seating and quirky pottery displays, creates a laid-back atmosphere that works equally well for a morning coffee or a casual lunch with friends.\n\nThe menu centres around proper thin-crust pizzas with quality toppings, alongside breakfast options, light meals, and a selection of deli items. The coffee is consistently good, and the vibe is unpretentious — it's the kind of place where you'll find everyone from families to business lunches to students catching up over a slice. The combination of good food, reasonable prices, and a pleasant courtyard makes it a reliable choice in the heart of George.",
